# ============================================================
# DeepSentinel Mobile
# R26-IT-121 | IT22109194 | Wijesinghe L P D B
# ============================================================
# Committed first, before any source. The repo root carries a
# repo-wide `*.json` rule, written when the model folders were
# notebook-first and .json meant "generated result". Here .json
# IS source: app.json, package.json and tsconfig.json are how the
# app is configured and installed.
#
# Without the re-inclusion below, `git add` reports nothing, the
# commit looks clean, and a clean clone has no package.json — so
# `npm install` fails and nobody can build the app. A deeper
# .gitignore wins over the root, which is what makes this work.

!*.json
!**/*.json

# ─── Node / Expo ───────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.expo/
.expo-shared/
dist/
web-build/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ─── Native build output (generated by `expo prebuild`) ────────
android/
ios/
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa
*.keystore
!debug.keystore

# ─── Secrets and local state ──────────────────────────────────
# The API base URL lives in app.config.js and is not a secret.
# Anything genuinely private goes in .env and stays out.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# ─── OS / editor ──────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*
